Context()->variables->are(n => 'Real');
$b = random(80, 150, 10);
$r = random(36, 44, 4);
$expression = Formula("$b + $r n");

######
# Body
######

BEGIN_PGML
An elementary school classroom needs a minimum of [`[$b]`] square feet for the teacher plus a minimum of [`[$r]`] square feet per student. Write an expression for the minimum square footage of a classroom with [`n`] students.

[_]{$expression}{20}

END_PGML

